NoxFS layout
============
Sector 0:
  0..3   magic  'NXFS'
  4..7   num_files (uint32 LE)
  8..    entries (32 B each):
           0..23   name (ASCII, null-padded)
           24..27  start_lba (uint32 LE)
           28..31  size_bytes (uint32 LE)

Files are stored contiguously starting at LBA 1.
Max 15 files; size up to 128 KB (single ata_read call).

Try: exec hello.elf
